<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10303"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 1:25 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->You are so right on this Juno. I can&#39;t believe people are selling stuff, let alone BUYing it! <BR> <BR>I know there are collectors of everything out there, though. <BR> <BR>shiverrrrrr!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
